": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9284HPEUMX4Q7kNvwGfOdpn&_nc_oc=AdoF5P6EmjGjmUsGuK3pIKRNA2iR8UUy5mIehZMZ5Y68NFvakF7t6ErEGzFedgGXF8g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLwrGVm_Vq7-kGmpumExWCRgIWVNXLOOHEwPNfbZ5unvw&oe=6AAA865B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=48liIuZ8gjMQ7kNvwEfRlIE&_nc_oc=AdqRZuMUGjgZMR-Djc2o6GgLLgX0egoqNBOInNhezKt2psZl5KvhyGxX4n0lBjwjc4E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL6W32YG9sgtuZG2j8Zw4_Ny6GHVrGxIEYMfKOeYVDi5Q&oe=6AAAAEE1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AiEgZ_FbsJ0Q7kNvwFc9Pu0&_nc_oc=AdrSOBzM1GJ6dIP2RF4fL4KXO4e7AwEIK_-vaBYyK1KM0BKw7R_tVUBGeMSohW9t63w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJoITi03yoKeDQy9NKl7a2gxkVO_P-TQ4vUdXd10JU0VA&oe=6AAA9BAF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rw0uxTNrf98Q7kNvwF3vNwm&_nc_oc=Adp5a-TaKosqQmp2WcSsH4iuLY53Wxh5XCjBKYwmcB9FVBxHjURLxiz0GLUloLtH0fw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL50k7e9EuzKBkuHzPBnNlI8z18T0QDAeMQ1O-m3tvrWg&oe=6AAA9B52"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SUwVGjMUi1gQ7kNvwF7lVCj&_nc_oc=AdpjHbHqEJ0CD66cDaWswo2iDlGK2JSjPD9xh8nlbr5_OXDqBM2zkvRyTGxBHAy96xQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL01s_DIsTNsi4m8uHnH-2sFfvv-fvrs-iclVRXGEuK3Q&oe=6AAAA4FD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a